l correction to Peru.","aqua_overpass":"Median daytime cell-day local solar time; minutes after local midnight.","structural_error":"Uncentered exp(log(predicted/reference)) residuals, sampled in whole year blocks shared across all regions and months. Aqua: test years; Terra: backcast years. Applied to pre-VIIRS years only, including mixed Terra/Aqua months. Zero predictions retain the limiting factor zero; no pseudocount. Interval endpoints include the unchanged point estimate.","annual_range":"Quantiles after summing aligned monthly and regional replicates; never a sum of interval endpoints.","validation":"Aqua/VIIRS comparison uses identical jointly available days. Naive error compares raw detections with cell-day estimates and is not a same-unit accuracy metric.","periods":"Monthly dominant reference; July of the Aqua start year includes a short Terra bridge. Availability substitutions remain in capture_segments.parquet.","mapbiomas":"Annual Pearson correlation on shared years, excluding the incomplete first year; burned area and active fire cell-days are different quantities. Macroregions sum MapBiomas annual department totals with the same department grouping; Peru uses the country total.","national_detection":"Peru rows sum regional calibration counts; p = summed counts / summed regional Chapman totals.","emulator_drift_latest":"Same comparison for the last year, restricted to months fully observed by S-NPP and to jointly available days.","static_source_mask":"Validation counts are standard-processing detections passing the confidence filter; mask_years overlap the first validation period (in-sample).","noaa20_ratio":"S-NPP/NOAA-20 cell-day ratio by region on S-NPP-available days; range from a month bootstrap; cv is the coefficient of variation of monthly ratios.","provisional":"NRT data are replaced by standard data in later FIRMS releases; the NRT-to-standard effect cannot be measured with this download."}}}
